# RUN(LATE): walk f4 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Guesses+Folding+LoopInvariants+Handlers
# LATE-NOT: StringBuilder
# RUN(LEFT): walk f5 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Guesses+Folding+LoopInvariants+Handlers
